# Response headers of the forum's host. Drop-in never synthesizes or removes them for documents.
# The identity page opens in a popup and answers its opener, so pages with the sign-in button must not send
# Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin; same-origin-allow-popups is safe. Referrer-Policy: no-referrer is advised.
/*
  X-Fixture-Host: example-forum
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
/css/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/data.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
